## Parameter Value Not Allowed :heavy_multiplication_x:

The command sets the parameter `{{ name }}` to `{{ value }}`, which is not one of the values the configuration allows.  The command starts no run.

{% if has_allowed -%}
The parameter `{{ name }}` accepts these values:

{% for allowed_value in allowed -%}
- `{{ allowed_value.value }}`
{% endfor -%}
{% else -%}
The parameter `{{ name }}` accepts no value at all, so no command can set it.
{% endif %}
The declared parameters and the values they accept are in the [parameters reference](https://stategraph.com/docs/reference/orchestration/configuration/parameters).
